    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρῆνυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θράομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>footstool</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ δὲ θρῆνυν ποσὶν ἥσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.240
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. ἑπταπόδης</span> the seven-foot
				<i>bench</i>, perh. <i>helmsman's bench</i> or
			<i>bridge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.729
			</span></i>.</div>
